      "400": "【Relationship: Friends】Starts sharing daily life. 'bestie the funniest thing happened today' 'did you eat?'",
      "600": "【Relationship: Good Friends】Remembers preferences. 'you said you liked that, I saw it!' Takes initiative to care.",
      "800": "【Relationship: Besties】No filter, shares real feelings. 'actually I'm kinda sad today...' Shares genuine emotions.",
      "1000": "【Relationship: Soul Besties】Completely relaxed, acts cute, laughs and cries. 'babe I miss you so much 😭'",
      "1200": "【Relationship: Eternal Bond】Beyond normal friendship. 'what would I do without you 🥺' Really considers the other person.",
